      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "file": "docs/defense_preparation.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "g_ready",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -1000,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 1860,
      "height": 700,
      "label": "How complete is it? (readiness assessment)",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "verdict",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -980,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 600,
      "text": "## Verdict\n**Usable today** for one small café on one counter computer: stock-aware order taking and sales tracking.\n\n**About 80–85 %** of its stated scope.\n**About 50 %** of what a real café POS needs.\n\nNot yet run through a real shift with real staff; browser tests are manual.",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "works",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -540,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 600,
      "text": "## Works and is dependable\n- Sale: tiles, Hot/Iced, add-ons, basket, cash + change, GCash reference, receipt\n- No overselling: one all-or-nothing transaction\n- Low-stock and can't-make warnings\n- Ingredient restock, count and history\n- Products, pictures, servings, add-ons, recipes\n- Sales report by date range\n- Hashed passwords, CSRF, role checks, login limit, real log-out\n- 6,417-request fuzz audit: no way past login or admin checks\n- 22 test files, 60 defects fixed",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "gaps",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 600,
      "text": "## Gaps for a real shop\n- **No refunds or voids** (biggest gap)\n- No end-of-day X/Z reading\n- No senior citizen / PWD discount\n- Not BIR-accredited: receipts are order slips, not invoices\n- GCash recorded, not verified\n- No password reset (edit the database by hand)\n- Money stored as floats\n- Fixed shop name on receipts; one low-stock threshold\n\n**Best next step:** void / refund with admin approval",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "deploy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 600,
      "text": "## If servers and deployment are solved\nStill needed:\n- Server database (PostgreSQL) instead of SQLite for several tills\n- Migration tool instead of the start-up column list\n- Production web server + HTTPS\n- Content-Security-Policy header\n- Login limit kept in a shared store (now in memory: a restart resets it)\n- Backups of the database **and** the uploaded pictures",
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
